{"version":1,"key":"card:447","content":{"id":447,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"print","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 可用于打印一个表达式，这个表达式要么是字符串，要么将自动转换为字符串。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5e982427-e338-4cd9-8622-a46fcbf7c71a","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"可同时打印多个表达式，是用逗号分隔，参数之间会插入一个空格字符","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c1e73e01-17b9-4786-82c2-56195d87f352","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> name = 'Gumby'\n>>> salutation = 'Mr.'\n>>> greeting = 'Hello,'\n>>> print(greeting, salutation, name)\nHello, Mr. Gumby","collabId":"b9535ca1-9ba8-4c04-95c5-2bc52edad8be","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"e4525008-83bb-41d2-8f54-189d212c1acd","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"9873ce26-cfeb-49b1-a221-c40013ede4e6"},{"children":[{"text":"使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"sep","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 自定义分隔符","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a7a625fe-2815-4ea6-9104-dd46267d3ad3","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> print(\"I\", \"wish\", \"to\", \"register\", \"a\", \"complaint\", sep=\"_\")\nI_wish_to_register_a_complaint","collabId":"5900089f-ce5d-4c68-87a1-2a537a936add","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"bbbdc579-f700-4fb3-ae54-328c7bf4a9fd","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"d6501a12-8435-498a-86da-990124892ef2"},{"children":[{"text":"使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"end","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 自定义结束字符串，以替换默认的换行符","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a6d15de9-3c88-4078-b2b1-e5c183253846","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"print('Hello,', end='')\nprint('world!')","collabId":"35c51def-3299-4f81-94df-87cb171a1f56","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"5e72ccc8-b1c9-4e08-9e8b-8daaa4e09d2f","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"24fe187d-3091-4f3d-9f76-926ae3751a2b"}],"tags":["Python"],"createTime":1719155825652,"updateTime":1793532525374,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532525374}}